; QNX Neutrino ARM options (mirror of i386/nto.opt).
; See the GCC internals manual (options.texi) for this file's format.

G
Driver

YP,
Driver Joined

; -pthread is a no-op on QNX (pthreads live in libc.so.3 - no separate
; libpthread, no extra defines needed), but portable build systems and
; Go's cgo pass it unconditionally; without this entry the driver rejects
; it as an unknown option.  Carried over from the 8.5 port so 4.9 stays a
; usable toolchain, not just an A/B baseline.
pthread
Driver

; Synonym for -Wl,--export-dynamic (mapped in nto.h LINK_SPEC, like
; gnu-user targets). Go's external linker and plugin-style software pass
; it unconditionally.  Carried over from the 8.5 port together with the
; -pthread entry above.
rdynamic
Driver

; This comment is to ensure we retain the blank line above.
